{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55261","headline":"洋川 一 · 和凝","name":"洋川 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华夷图上见洋川，知在青山绿水边。\n[□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□]。\n官闲最好游僧舍，江近应须买钓船，更待浃旬无事後，徧题清景作诗仙。\n（见王象之《舆地纪胜》卷一九○。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}